WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.750
The population changes because survivors pass on their colours; no beetle changes.

2
00:00:06.474 --> 00:00:10.974
Beetles vary in colour. Birds eat the ones that stand out most.

3
00:00:15.386 --> 00:00:18.611
The survivors breed, and their young are like them.

4
00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:34.910
Over generations the population blends in, but no single beetle changed.
